text She made this body of mine.
text It's made out of junk.
text The pieces of junk dot this vast plain, scattered among the dry grass. They're buried in the ground and their corners jut out from the earth.
text They look like corpses of some sort to me.
text Tons of dead bodies.
text All kinds of dead bodies.
text As I think about it, I shudder.
text My body is made of those pieces.
text Yet this junk was able to come together to make a proper body.
text It's not as if I find my limbs suddenly falling off for no reason.
text In that case, it should be possible to make another conscious junk-doll, just like how I was made.
text If you search around here, you can find all the scrap you'd ever need.
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s22
fi
