text She looks at me quizzically as I do it.
text I try to connect the pieces of scrap together in front of her.
text But while I may be able to put one piece into another, they always fall apart.
text She understands what I'm trying to do though and does it for me.
text This time, the pieces stay.
text I point to my own body.
text ..."You want a new body?"
text I cross my arms to tell her that this has nothing to do with me.
text ..."A friend? You want a friend?"
text That's not why I'm doing this. I just felt like things would be more fun if there were more dolls like me around.
text But either way, the result will be the same. So I nod.
text ..."Yes, I guess you're right. You were lonely by yourself. I'm sorry."
text That's... not true. But I continue to stare up at the girl's face.
text ..."I might not be able to do it... Is that okay?"
text I nod.
text ..."Then I'll try."
text The girl begins to put the junk together.
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s24
fi
