text When we run out of parts, we walk around the plain to find more.
text We go back and forth, making trip after trip.
text It's only after doing this that I begin to realize something:
text Making my body was so much work.
setvar strS[1000] = "BG305"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s25
fi
goto 26
label s25
setvar strS[1000] = ""
